 sampling:{title:'Sampling Distribution',icon:'≈',category:'Foundation',desc:'Lihat bagaimana statistic berubah dari sample ke sample dan mengapa sample size menentukan sampling variability.',short:'Eksplorasi population, one sample, sampling distribution, dan Standard Error.',learn:['Pisahkan population distribution, satu random sample, dan sampling distribution dari mean atau median.','Untuk sample mean, theoretical Standard Error = SD / √n. Makin besar n, semakin sempit sampling distribution.','Sampling distribution dari median dapat berbeda karakter dari distribusi mean.'],try:'Bandingkan Small n dan Large n pada population Skewed tanpa mengganti parameter lain.',controls:[choice('dist','Population distribution',['Normal','Skewed','Uniform','Bimodal'],'Skewed'),choice('stat','Statistic',['Mean','Median'],'Mean'),range('n','Sample size (n)',5,300,30,5),range('reps','Number of samples',100,5000,1000,100),number('mu','Population mean',50),number('sigma','Population SD',10,.1),seed('seed',101)],presets:{'Small n, skewed population':{dist:'Skewed',stat:'Mean',n:10,reps:2000},'Large n, skewed population':{dist:'Skewed',stat:'Mean',n:150,reps:2000},'Median under skew':{dist:'Skewed',stat:'Median',n:30,reps:2000},'Bimodal population':{dist:'Bimodal',stat:'Mean',n:20,reps:2000}}},
